        <h3 id="allaboutdurham_modal_title">All about Durham</h3>

        <p>Durham is a historic cathedral city in the North East of England, built on a loop of the River Wear and crowned by the UNESCO World Heritage Site of Durham Cathedral and Castle.</p>

        <p>From medieval streets and riverside walks to lively markets, independent cafés, and a thriving university community, the city blends ancient heritage with everyday local life.</p>

        <p>Whether you are visiting for a day, studying at the university, or exploring County Durham more widely, Discover Durham is here to help you find landmarks, events, food, and places worth seeing.</p>

